## OV15 — Adversarial qualification and final release seal

**Artifact:** `dustui_go_ov15_adversarial_final_release_seal_v1.zip`  
**Maps to audit:** GO18 + GO19; RC-13 final closure; all unresolved ledger items.

### Purpose

